{"memory_id": "MEM_20260510_0004", "memory_type": "long_term_investment_memory", "status": "active", "title": "ED arrests Sanjeev Arora; raids across north India; Hampton Sky Realty Ltd premises searched; PMLA case registered", "summary": "ED arrests Sanjeev Arora; raids across north India; Hampton Sky Realty Ltd premises searched; PMLA case registered", "memory_scope": ["region", "company"], "time_horizon": "short_term", "linked_entities": ["Sanjeev Arora", "Enforcement Directorate", "Hampton Sky Realty Ltd", "Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA)"], "linked_themes": [], "linked_events": ["EVT_20260510_0099", "EVT_20260510_0090"], "linked_facts": [], "linked_claims": [], "source_refs": [{"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00066", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00066_C01", "supporting_text": "The Enforcement Directorate arrested Sanjeev Arora on Saturday in a fresh money laundering case linked to him and certain entities allegedly associated with him, officials said to news agency PTI. Sanjeev Arora was taken into custody under the Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA) after ED teams conducted raids at his official residence in Chandigarh from early morning. The ED carried out searches at five locations across north India as part of the investigation. The raids also covered two premises in New Delhi and the premises of Hampton Sky Realty Ltd in Gurugram\u2019s Udyog Vihar. Officials said the searches were launched after the central agency registered a fresh case under the criminal provisions of the Prevention of Money Laundering Act (PMLA).", "published_at": "2026-05-09T16:34:24+05:30", "source_reliability": "medium_high"}, {"document_id": "DOC_20260510_00059", "source_id": "moneycontrol", "chunk_id": "DOC_20260510_00059_C01", "supporting_text": "The Enforcement Directorate (ED) conducted the fresh searches against Arora and some others allegedly linked to him as part of an investigation into a newly-registered money-laundering case, offici